---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Writing" path="/writing" description="Essays from Joe Neiman on entrepreneurship, deals, flying, and health. A book is on the way.">
  <h1>Writing</h1>

  <p class="lede">
    One substantial piece at a time: a decision I just made, an opportunity I
    chased or passed on, a story from the auction business or the hangar, and
    what each one taught me.
  </p>
  <p>
    The essays are on their way, and they're all feeding something bigger: a book
    about entrepreneurship, built from what actually happened.
  </p>
  <p class="muted">
    Want the pieces as they come out? A newsletter signup will live here.
    <mark class="pending">newsletter platform decision pending (Substack test vs own list)</mark>
  </p>

  <div class="wf-note">Wireframe note: this page becomes the article index once the weekly cadence starts; the blog machinery (articles collection, schema) is already wired in the repo from the Picks stack.</div>
</BaseLayout>
